@startuml
title Step 3 - Provide Delivery Address and Choose Shipping Options

actor person
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM
participant "ProductOrderCapture\n& Validation" as POCV
participant "ProductConfigurator" as PC
participant "LocationManagement" as LM

activate EM
activate POCV

group Access Delivery Address selection
    note over POCV : ProductConfigurator requests a delivery address for Fiber Access
    EM -> EM : 30 display Address entry screen
    person -> EM : 31 provide delivery address\nand validate
    EM -> LM : 32 **TMF673 Geographic Address Mgt** POST geographicAddressValidation\n(deliveryAddress)
    activate LM
    LM -> LM : 33 check address
    LM --> EM : 34 **TMF673** 201 Created\n(validationResult = success)
    deactivate LM
    EM -> PC : 35 **TMF760 Product Configuration** POST /queryProductConfiguration\n(configured delivery address + all previous validated configuration on all offerings\nOR ProductConfiguration.idx of all previous configurations done during the process)
    activate PC
    PC --> EM : 36 **TMF760** 200 OK\n(new items/characteristics to be configured + pricing information)\nOR 201 Created
    deactivate PC
end

group shipping option selection
    note over POCV : ProductConfigurator requests a shipping offer
    EM -> EM : 37 display shipping options\nwith default values selected
    person -> EM : 38 configure shipping\nand validate
    EM -> PC : 39 **TMF760 Product Configuration** POST /queryProductConfiguration\n(selected shipping offering + configured address + all previous validated configuration on main offerings\nOR ProductConfiguration.idx of all previous configurations done during the process)
    activate PC
    PC --> EM : 40 **TMF760** 200 OK\n(configuration proposed and status for each item)\nOR 201 Created
    deactivate PC
end

== Delegation to Configuration close and POCV take again process responsability ==

person -> EM : 41 valid shipping option
EM -> POCV : 42 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow/4/taskFlow/2\n(SessionId, full configuration OR ProductConfiguration.idx of all previous configurations done during the process)

POCV -> PC : 43 **TMF760 Product Configuration** POST /checkProductConfiguration\n(latest configuration selected by user for main offerings (items for fiber, add-ons, shipping)\nOR ProductConfiguration.idx of all previous configurations done during the process)
activate PC
PC --> POCV : 44 **TMF760** 201 Created\n(state=approved)
deactivate PC

POCV --> EM : 45 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(SessionId, ProcessId4, available actions:\nTaskId4 Validate Order [productOrder7],\nTaskId99 quit)
deactivate EM

POCV -> POCV : 46 **TMF622 Product Order Mgt** PATCH /productOrder/7\n(draft, offeringId25,26,89 with full configuration, partyId8)\nor **TMF663 Shopping Cart Mgt** PATCH /shoppingCart/7\n(offeringId25,26,89 with full configuration, partyId8)
deactivate POCV

@enduml
